    Summary: "Initializes a player's avatar with the given prefab instance. For non-local\n
      avatars, runs the performance-limit trim pass before setup so excess\n components
      are gone before the avatar driver caches renderer/component\n references. The
      resulting trim counts are stashed on the remote player so\n the individual-player
      menu can show exactly what got removed."
