    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Mode 2 (in-scene) avatar bypasses ContentPolice, so this is the only
      place the\n authoring BasisHeadChop components get processed for that path.\n
      When `destination` is non-null (local load), targets are appended;\n the components
      themselves are always destroyed so BasisHeadChop never persists at\n runtime
      \u2014 including on remote in-scene avatars where `destination`\n is null and
      only the strip happens."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
