    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Session-only \"show me everything\" switch. When true, Evaluate\n and
      TrimExcessComponents both short-circuit to no-ops and\n DetermineAction tells
      the reconcile pass to restore any\n currently-blocked or currently-trimmed
      avatar. Not persisted through\n BasisSettingsSystem \u2014 resets to false
      every launch \u2014 so\n it's safe to use as a quick \"what does this actually
      look like?\" diagnostic\n without risk of the user accidentally leaving it
      on forever."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
