  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Avatar.BasisContentTagFilter
    MemberName: BasisContentTagFilter
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "User-side blocklist of content tags. Content authors stamp tags into
      the bee\n bundle's `BasisBundleDescription.Tags`; users tick boxes here to
      refuse\n content carrying those tags. Honor system \u2014 only enforces tags
      creators\n declared, but the comparison itself is mandatory once configured.\n\n
      Storage is a single JSON-encoded BasisSettingsBinding{T} string\n because the
      binding layer only knows about primitives. Reads parse the JSON\n on demand
      and cache the result so the hot IsBlocked path on\n every avatar/scene/prop
      load doesn't re-parse."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
