    Summary: "Default blocks the most-likely-to-disturb categories (\"18+\", \"Horror\",\n
      \"Gore\") so a brand-new user isn't surprised by them on first load. Still\n
      honor-system \u2014 only enforces tags creators declared \u2014 but a safer\n
      out-of-box opt-out beats a permissive default for first impressions.\n Users
      can clear or extend the list from the settings panel."
