    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Drives IK tracker targets from an AnimationClip for testing IK quality\n
      without wearing VR hardware. Creates a hidden reference skeleton from the\n
      local avatar, samples the clip onto it each frame, and feeds bone world\n positions
      into the tracker system as simulated devices.\n\n Usage:\n   1. Add this component
      to any GameObject in the scene\n   2. Assign a humanoid AnimationClip\n   3.
      Enter Play mode and call Play() or set IsPlaying = true in the inspector\n  
      4. The avatar will be driven by the animation through the full IK pipeline"
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
