    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "How long to wait after the last perf-limit setting change before running
      the\n reconcile pass. Must be long enough to absorb a fast click-through of
      the\n Performance Limits tab but short enough that the user sees the effect
      of a\n single change without obvious latency."
    Remarks: 
