  - TypeFullName: Basis.BasisUI.BasisLocalization
    MemberName: BasisLocalization
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Lightweight key-value localization for Basis UI.\n\n Language JSON
      files are loaded via Addressables using the\n LanguageLabel label and use the
      same KeyValue list format\n as BasisSettingsSystem, so they round-trip through\n
      UnityEngine.JsonUtility without custom parsing. Going through Addressables\n
      (instead of File.IO against StreamingAssets) is required because on\n Android
      the APK packs StreamingAssets into a compressed archive and\n Directory.GetFiles
      silently returns nothing \u2014 language discovery was\n broken on mobile builds.\n\n
      Japanese (and other CJK languages) require a TMP font asset that includes\n
      the relevant glyph set. The default Basis TMP font only ships with Latin\n
      characters, so a CJK-capable fallback font must be assigned to\n TMP_Settings.fallbackFontAssets
      (or to the individual text labels) for\n translated strings to render correctly."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
