      label, parses each, and\n caches the resulting tables plus the available-language
      dropdown.\n\n \n\nUses `WaitForCompletion` intentionally: language data is\n
      local, tiny, and must be ready before any UI renders. The content\n is copied
      into managed dictionaries so the Addressable handle is\n released immediately
      after parsing."
