    Summary: "Connects an OpenLipSync (ONNX neural, 15 visemes) inference context
      to an avatar's\n facial rig. Contexts are created lazily when the player enters
      viseme range and\n released when they leave range, so only nearby players consume
      ONNX resources.\n This scales to 1000+ players because distant players never
      allocate inference contexts."
