  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Drivers.
    MemberName: ProcessAllPending
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Call after all individual Simulate() calls complete.\n Collects all
      pending contexts and processes them sequentially in a single\n background task.
      This avoids thread pool saturation and ONNX session contention\n that occurs
      when each context spawns its own Task.Run().\n\n Scales to 1000+ audio sources
      because:\n - Only in-range contexts with new audio are processed\n - Single
      background task, no thread pool flooding\n - Per-batch budget caps work per
      frame"
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
