  - TypeFullName: BasisLocalHandDriver
    MemberName: BasisLocalHandDriver
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Drives per-finger poses for both hands. Bakes a 2D pose grid at init
      time,\n then each frame schedules two chained Burst jobs:\n   1) BasisFingerInterpolateJob
      \u2014 bilinearly interpolates targets from the grid\n   2) BasisFingerSlerpJob
      \u2014 slerps current rotations toward targets and writes transforms\n Follows
      the Simulate/Apply pattern used by BasisObjectSyncDriver and JigglePhysics.\n\n
      Pose grid data is cached per humanoid Avatar asset. Loading the same avatar
      a second\n time copies from cache instead of re-instantiating and sampling
      441 poses."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
