  - TypeFullName: ComputeSkeletonRotationsJob
    MemberName: ComputeSkeletonRotationsJob
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: IJobParallelFor
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Burst IJobParallelFor that composes T-pose local rotation with the
      network delta into\n a final localRotation per bone. Splitting this off the
      transform-write path lets the\n math fully spread across worker threads \u2014
      IJobParallelForTransform serializes bones\n inside each root hierarchy (51
      bones per avatar on a single core), which made the\n combined apply job the
      heaviest in the pipeline."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
