  - TypeFullName: BasisNetworkHandleCompressedBundle
    MemberName: BasisNetworkHandleCompressedBundle
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Decodes one server-emitted avatar bundle on BasisNetworkCommons.CompressedAvatarBundleChannel\n
      and dispatches each inner message back through BasisNetworkHandleAvatar.HandleAvatarUpdate\n
      as if it had been received on its original quality channel.\n\n Wire format
      (must match BasisServerReductionSystemEvents on the server):\n   [count:1][rawLen:2-LE][LZ4
      block( [origChannel:1][msgLen:2-LE][bytes]* )]\n\n rawLen is authoritative
      \u2014 count is just a sanity hint. Each inner [bytes] is exactly\n what the
      server would have sent on origChannel individually, so quality / additional-data\n
      presence / id-size are all derived from origChannel by the existing handler."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
