  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Networking.NetworkedAvatar.BasisBoneDeltaAndCompressJob
    MemberName: BasisBoneDeltaAndCompressJob
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: IJob
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Burst-compiled job that computes T-pose-relative bone deltas and compresses
      them\n into a packed byte buffer using smallest-three quaternion encoding.\n\n
      Replaces the main-thread ExtractBoneDeltas() + CompressBoneRotations() calls\n
      with a single Burst-optimized pass. The job reads current bone local rotations\n
      (written by a prior TransformAccessArray read), computes deltas against cached\n
      T-pose rotations, and writes the compressed bitstream.\n\n This runs as an
      IJob (not parallel) because the bit-packed output is sequential.\n Burst still
      provides significant wins via SIMD quaternion math and branch elimination."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
