      existing clip is destroyed (not pooled) so a stale-sized clip can't\n re-enter
      circulation when the pool's BasisAudioClipPool.ClipBufferScalar\n has just
      changed. AudioSource, transform, viseme driver, and Steam Audio\n component
      are all preserved \u2014 only the underlying clip is replaced."
