    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Sentinel reset used when we don't yet have a real network scale to
      seed\n with (slot-reuse cleanup at Initialize time). Forces the next\n UpdateAllAvatarsJob
      tick to flag HasScaleChange so whatever value\n propagates through the pipeline
      gets applied to the transform.\n Completes any in-flight oneEuroJob first for
      the same reason as\n SeedScaleState.\n Prefer SeedScaleState when you have
      the stashed scale."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
