    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Schedules a single Burst BulkCopyHipsAndDeriveJob that\n fans out the
      network's per-player state (hips world pose, scale,\n hips local deltas) into
      the apply pipeline's packed buffers AND\n derives the root world pose in the
      same pass. Replaces the old\n ScheduleBulkCopyHipsAndScale + ScheduleBulkCopyHipsLocalDeltas
      +\n ComputeRootFromHipsJob trio \u2014 one dispatch instead of three, and no\n
      round-trip through hips-delta temp buffers.\n playerKeys[i] \u2192 internal
      SoA index; data is written to dst arrays at index i.\n TPose hips local pos/rot
      are passed in by the caller (per-player cache\n owned by RemoteBoneJobSystem)."
