      toward the last ~5 s of traffic. 0 means no losses seen; 0.1 means ~10% of\n
      expected packets were missing. Useful as an indicator that the network is\n
      degraded enough to warrant bumping LocalOpusSettings.PacketLossPercent\n (which
      drives Opus FEC aggressiveness on the encoder side)."
