    Summary: "Burst job that enforces the MaxVisibleAvatars cap.\n Scheduled after
      the distance job (reads its outputs), runs in parallel with the reduce job.\n
      Uses quickselect (O(n) average) to partition the closest N candidates from
      the rest,\n then flips AvatarRange to false for everyone beyond the cap."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
