    Summary: "Burst parallel job: computes per-player directional dampening multipliers.\n
      Reads targetPositions (shared [ReadOnly] with the distance job) so it can\n
      run fully in parallel with distance, reduce, and cap jobs.\n Output is written
      to a NativeArray; the caller copies to managed AudioReceiverModule\n in a trivial
      main-thread loop."
