    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 1
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Debounce state for avatar range transitions. View-cone and avatar-cap
      checks\n can flip `pAvatarRange[i]` rapidly when the local player rotates or\n
      crowds shift, which would otherwise trigger a burst of ReloadAvatar calls and\n
      flash every affected player to the loading avatar. We require the new value
      to\n remain stable for AvatarRangeDebounceSeconds before committing."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
