    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Per-player override that tells the avatar performance filter to treat
      this\n remote as if no limits were enabled. Set from the individual-player
      menu\n so the local user can look at a specific avatar at full fidelity without\n
      touching their global caps or the session-wide\n Basis.Scripts.Avatar.BasisAvatarPerformanceLimits.BypassAllLimits\n
      toggle. Deliberately System.NonSerializedAttribute \u2014 resets\n to false
      every launch, every reconnect, and every fresh player join, so\n there's no
      accidental \"I forgot I disabled the filter for Alice\"."
    Remarks: 
