    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Score nearby avatar players and registered BasisGazeTarget objects,
      pick best target.\n Computes social triangle focus points (left eye, right
      eye, mouth) for the winner.\n\n Three phases:\n   1) Main thread builds NativeArray
      inputs (managed reads of FaceIsVisible /\n      transform.position / sticky
      managed-ref equality have to happen here).\n   2) BasisGazeSelectionJob scores
      everything in Burst.\n   3) Main thread reads the result, fetches the winning
      managed BasisGazeTarget\n      reference if applicable, and computes the social
      triangle yaw/pitch."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
