      Every limit\n is a (toggle, slider) pair \u2014 the toggle flips `UsePerfLimit*`
      on, the slider\n sets the corresponding `MaxPerf*` threshold. All values live
      in\n BasisSettingsDefaults and are applied at runtime by\n `SMModuleAvatarPerformanceLimits`,
      which re-evaluates every currently-loaded\n remote avatar when any value changes."
