    Summary: "Adds a toggle and slider for a single limit. The toggle controls whether
      the\n limit is enforced; the slider sets the threshold. When the toggle is
      off the\n slider's entire GameObject is hidden so the settings panel only shows
      the\n knob for an active limit \u2014 matches how VRChat / NeosVR hide inactive
      options.\n `displayMode` lets large-number sliders (triangles, bones)\n opt
      into the compact \"1k / 32.5k / 2M\" readout instead of raw integers."
