    Summary: "Compiles shader variants for every shared material on every renderer
      in `renderers`\n before they're rendered for the first time.\n Caller is expected
      to have already walked the hierarchy (e.g. ContentPoliceControl's component\n
      pass) so we don't pay for a second GetComponentsInChildren.\n Synchronous:
      the caller is presumably on a loading screen, so the WarmUp stall is masked."
