    Summary: "When true, the avatar reduction system bundles per-receiver avatar
      messages\n and emits them deflated on CompressedAvatarBundleChannel. Falls
      back to\n per-message uncompressed sends when a receiver has too few queued
      messages\n for compression to be worthwhile, or when the compressed result
      would\n exceed peer MTU. Clients must implement the matching decoder."
    Remarks: 
