    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 1
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Wire format on BasisNetworkCommons.ServerLibraryChannel:\n   [u16 rawLen][u16
      compressedLen][bytes payload]\n If `compressedLen == 0` the payload is the
      raw ServerLibraryMessage\n bytes. Otherwise the payload is LZ4-encoded and
      decompresses to `rawLen` bytes.\n\n The wire payload is cached and only rebuilt
      when the admin mutates the\n library (via BroadcastLibraryToAll). Per-peer
      joins just\n memcpy the cached bytes into a pooled writer \u2014 zero new allocations
      on\n the hot path."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
