    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 0
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Builds an unreliable NetPacket from raw user bytes and enqueues it,
      skipping the\n intermediate NetDataWriter copy. Thread-safe: uses the same
      _unreliableChannel\n queue as Send(), so Update() merges it on the logic thread.\n
      Optionally patches a single byte at patchOffset (relative to user data start)\n
      after the copy \u2014 used for per-receiver fields like interval that differ
      per\n destination while the source array is shared.\n Pass patchOffset = -1
      to skip patching."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
