  - TypeFullName: Basis.Network.Core.Compression.BasisBoneRotationCompression
    MemberName: BasisBoneRotationCompression
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    BaseTypeName: 
    Interfaces: []
    IsAbstract: 0
    IsSealed: 0
    IsStatic: 1
    IsPartial: 0
    IsMemberStatic: 0
    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Bone rotation compression using \"smallest three\" quaternion encoding.\n
      Pure C# \u2014 no Unity dependencies. Can run on the server.\n\n Each bone
      is assigned a bits-per-component (BPC) value based on its DOF:\n   3-DOF body
      joints: 10 BPC (32 bits total)\n   2-DOF limb joints: 8 BPC (26 bits total)\n  
      2-DOF extremities: 7 BPC (23 bits total)\n   1-2 DOF toes/eyes/jaw: 5 BPC (17
      bits total)\n   2-DOF finger proximal: 6 BPC (20 bits total)\n   1-DOF finger
      mid/distal: 4 BPC (14 bits total)"
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
