    IsMemberReadOnly: 0
    IsMemberConst: 0
    IsMemberVirtual: 0
    IsMemberOverride: 0
    Summary: "Dedicated tick loop running on its own thread with sub-millisecond
      precision.\n Replaces the async Task.Delay approach which had ~15ms resolution
      on Windows,\n limiting tick rate to ~70Hz. This achieves the target tick rate
      of ~250Hz (4ms).\n Uses coarse Thread.Sleep for long waits + SpinWait for precise
      final timing."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
