    Summary: Gets server's distance from the reference clock.
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: "Distance from the reference clock. This property is set only in server
      reply packets.\n Servers connected directly to reference clock hardware set
      this property to 1.\n Statum number is incremented by 1 on every hop down the
      NTP server hierarchy.\n \n\n\n\n\n Special value 0 indicates that this packet
      is a Kiss-o'-Death message\n with kiss code stored in NtpPacket.ReferenceId."
    Examples: []
